   "WORMHOLES: SHORTCUT OR SCI-FI? PART 3  ·  BLACK HOLES AS LABS Wormhole = a tunnel through spacetime that would link two far-apart places Einstein's equations allow wormhole solutions on paper. ESTABLISHED FACT Keeping one open would need 'exotic' matter with negative energy (Morris & Thorne, 1988). INFORMED SPECULATION No wormhole has ever been observed. ESTABLISHED FACT Whether they can exist in nature at all: UNKNOWN",
